1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,400
Your AI just onboarded half a customer.
Then billing died. Who undoes the other five?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,470
REVERSA is the recovery control plane
for enterprise AI operations.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:17,280
It plans across five systems, shows every
effect before execution, and waits for your
approval.

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:23,600
Every action is executed, verified, and sealed
in a hash-chained evidence passport.

5
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:30,700
When step six fails, dependents are blocked,
and seven effects are compensated in reverse
order.

6
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:37,570
No orphaned state. No hand-wavy logs.
Just a verifiable proof you can check offline.

7
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:43,170
One command verifies the chain offline.
Eighty-one events. Valid.

8
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,660
REVERSA. Built on Vultr.
Reversible where possible. Accountable
everywhere.
